    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yuda Yehoahasi garmoó Yosia nguri waawutmoó wa qaasiyé' kitángw baabuúwós wa ale baraá Yerusalemuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár nee tám. Ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ii'ín slahheeri tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yehoahasi kuri hingeés nee waawutmoó Misri baraá Yerusalemu, múk yaamaá Yuda ohme gari bu'ún dír waawutmoó Misri. Ohmér ta haniís a kílo kume tám nee tsiire tsiyáhh ar peésa, nee kílo mibeeri tám nee tsiyáhh ar sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmoó Misri Eliakimu hhiyoó Yehoahasi guri qaás kitángw Yehoahasi wa ale, iwa waawuti'in baraá Yuda nee Yerusalemúr wa ale, guri uma warqeés, guri báy Yehoyakimu. Yehoahasi kuri ar tláy yaamaá Misri nee waawutmo Neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár nee kooán, ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ín kureeri mibaá nee wak. Inós tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Nebukadnesa oo Babuloni guri i haratláy, guri tseék ar piíngu, guri huúw Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadnesa sleeme xooslár Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gana bahh ar tláy ay yaamaá Babuloni, gari qaás baraá do'ós oo waawuti'iima kuduú Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa naa meetiye' awa Yehoyakimu aa tlehhiít, dinkwa nee muruudá' slasla/arén aa tlehhiiti, kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú waawituú Israeli nee oo Yuda. Garmaawós Yehoyakini iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a dakaát",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dakaát:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baraá 2 Wat 24:8 gár taa gooín a mibaá nee dakaát.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ín slahheeri tam nee deelo mibaangw. Inós tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá kurkú wák iwa waaraáhh waawutmo Nebukadnesa mukós guna ya/aáw Yehoyakini kuwa huwi baraá yaamaá Babuloni dinkwa nee xosluudá' tlaxo uren ar Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Sedekia hhiyoó Yehoyakini guri waawutmoó Yuda nee oo Yerusalemúr wa qaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
