          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekia waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár nee wák, ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ín kureeri mibaá nee wak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwose, tam inós taa niinaweesiiká dír geeraá aarusmo Yeremia, kudá' axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gaa dirós i kah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekia kángw waawutmo Nebukadnesa axaasaro guri sií' tam Nebukadnesa Sedekia ngwa lo'ór /aymisi ar baraá umuú Mungú as tidá' Nebukadnesa i ooi mingiwa sií'. Inós da/eewawós giri gawdeés, tam guruuwós guri tlaa/árí dahaás as miwa kií/ amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam kaahamuusér Mungú tidá' uren sleémeero nee muu sleémeero, niri inkihhimu wasleesiyé', asma tlehhmi'iidá' ta waki awa xoordaá hatlá' ngina eehariyé', tam doó Mungú nguri meetagaasiyé', kudá' inósuú kilá' aa hhoohhooeés oo baraá Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'ii'ín, umuú daqto ya/abuuseerós gana amor'ín i ya/abiít, asma mukós nguwa gurtlay nee didár hootawose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inooín tana kumiít ya/abuuseedá' Mungú aa ya/abiít ngiwa niqina', nee axweesantós ngiwa siaasi'iya', nee aaruuseerós ngiwa waaqaseesena'. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mukós guri ló'wa i buúhh, tam adór ni kotsqotiya' iri qwát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ waawutmoó Kaldayo guri amor'ín i tleés. Inós masoombar'ín gari tsuú/ baraá guruú dooín kudá' hhoohhoó' i aleeró, slám hee tumu wák oo taa gurtláy i kaahh, tam dasi laqaá garma, laqaá heé aa din, laqaá oo liitlakusmo. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ muu sleémeero guna haniís gawaá dabaá waawutmoó múk Kaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoosla sleémeero ar uren nee ar ninakwe ar doó Mungú, nee daqaari'iimár Doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, nee daqaari'iimár waawutmoowo, nee daqaari'iimár geeraharuuseero, sleémeero gari huúw ay yaamaá Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doó Mungú guri daá/, koo/ír Yerusalemu gari feé/, maraá waawuti'iima giri daá/ nee xoosla sleémeero ar tlaxo gawden gari hhaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdaádá' sleémeero aa /uy tsu/utaaro guri ar tláy ay Babuloni, guri lawaaleerós tleéhh nee lawaalér daaqaywós ay qoomár waawuti'iimár Persia iwa iimu/uún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorihe axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tidá' aa oó' ar loohír aarusmo Yeremia iri bó/, tidá' kah, «Yaamaá i hootiya' i tawo iwiitiyá', ki doosliiká ay kureeri mibeeri faanqw, ar adoodá' kureeraá Sabaáto awa taa boo/eesiiká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú geera oo waawuti'iimár Koreshiwo waawutmoó yaamaá Persia as axweesantadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa oó' ar afkú aarusmo Yeremia iwa bo/, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ muunuú waawutmo Koreshi oo Persia guri gwarangwaár, inós afo gari ilahaniís baraá waawuti'iimarós sleémeero, barwiito'o gari gooín sleeme, iwa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawutmo Koreshi oo Persia i kaahi, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú doori, waawuti'iima sleémeero ar yaamu ngaa aníngií haniís, nee aníng iga ádbáy do'ós kuduú baraá Yerusalemu tidár yaamaá Yuda nguwa tleehh. Umuúqo heewo kuduú kós baraá tla/angwhunge, masók AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúwós i dinkwa nee inós, nee i watli.› »",
          "type": "text",
